<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Microsoft Digital Defense Report 2024 - Chapter 1</title>
    <style>
        body {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            background-color: #0d0716;
            color: #ffffff;
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;
            overflow: hidden;
            height: 100vh;
            width: 100vw;
        }

        /* Top Navigation Bar */
        .top-nav {
            display: flex;
            height: 36px;
            font-size: 13px;
            width: 100%;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        .nav-section {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 0 16px;
        }

        .nav-white {
            background-color: #ffffff;
            color: #000000;
        }

        .nav-purple {
            background-color: #3b2d59;
            color: #ffffff;
        }

        .nav-yellow {
            background-color: #ffb900;
            color: #000000;
            font-weight: 600;
            justify-content: center;
            width: 40px;
            padding: 0;
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }

        .hamburger {
            font-size: 18px;
            margin-right: 16px;
            line-height: 1;
        }

        .report-title {
            margin-right: 16px;
        }

        .nav-item {
            color: #555555;
            margin-right: 16px;
        }

        .nav-item:last-child {
            margin-right: 0;
        }

        .nav-white.right-side {
            flex-grow: 1;
            gap: 24px;
            color: #555555;
        }
        .nav-white.right-side .nav-item {
            margin-right: 0;
        }

        /* Main Content Area */
        .main-area {
            position: relative;
            width: 100%;
            height: calc(100vh - 36px);
        }

        /* Background Graphic Placeholder */
        .bg-graphic-placeholder {
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            background: radial-gradient(circle at 60% 50%, #3a1c4a 0%, #0d0716 60%);
            z-index: 0;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
        }

        .bg-graphic-placeholder::after {
            content: '[Particle Swirl Graphic: Center-Right]';
            color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
            font-size: 24px;
            border: 2px dashed rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
            padding: 20px;
            position: absolute;
            right: 10%;
            top: 40%;
        }

        /* Decorative Lines */
        .line-horizontal {
            position: absolute;
            top: 120px;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 1px;
            background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4);
            z-index: 2;
        }

        .line-vertical {
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 80px;
            width: 1px;
            height: 100%;
            background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
            z-index: 2;
        }

        /* Arrow Box */
        .arrow-box {
            position: absolute;
            top: 105px;
            left: 65px;
            width: 30px;
            height: 30px;
            background-color: #ffea99;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            color: #000000;
            font-size: 18px;
            z-index: 10;
        }

        /* Content Grid */
        .content-grid {
            position: absolute;
            top: 121px;
            left: 81px;
            width: calc(100% - 81px);
            height: calc(100% - 121px);
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            z-index: 5;
        }

        /* Left Panel */
        .left-panel {
            background-color: rgba(26, 17, 44, 0.9);
            width: 42%;
            height: 80%;
            padding: 40px;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        .chapter-num {
            color: #ffb900;
            font-size: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
        }

        .chapter-title {
            font-size: 48px;
            font-weight: 400;
            line-height: 1.1;
            margin: 0 0 32px 0;
            letter-spacing: -0.5px;
        }

        .chapter-subtitle {
            font-size: 26px;
            font-weight: 300;
            line-height: 1.3;
            margin: 0;
        }

        /* Right Panel (TOC) */
        .right-panel {
            width: 45%;
            padding: 30px 80px 0 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        .toc {
            list-style: none;
            padding: 0;
            margin: 0;
            border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
        }

        .toc li {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            padding: 14px 0;
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
            font-size: 15px;
        }

        .toc-page {
            font-weight: 600;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="top-nav">
        <div class="nav-section nav-white">
            <span class="hamburger">&#9776;</span>
            <span class="report-title">Microsoft Digital Defense Report 2024</span>
            <span class="nav-item">Overview</span>
        </div>
        <div class="nav-section nav-purple">
            The evolving cyber threat landscape
        </div>
        <div class="nav-section nav-white right-side">
            <span class="nav-item">Centering our organizations on security</span>
            <span class="nav-item">Early insights: AI's impact on cybersecurity</span>
            <span class="nav-item">Appendix</span>
        </div>
        <div class="nav-section nav-yellow">
            8
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="main-area">
        <div class="bg-graphic-placeholder placeholder"></div>

        <div class="line-horizontal"></div>
        <div class="line-vertical"></div>

        <div class="arrow-box">&#8600;</div>

        <div class="content-grid">
            <div class="left-panel">
                <div class="chapter-num">Chapter 1</div>
                <h1 class="chapter-title">The evolving cyber<br>threat landscape</h1>
                <p class="chapter-subtitle">How have trends and<br>tactics changed?</p>
            </div>

            <div class="right-panel">
                <ul class="toc">
                    <li><span>Key developments</span><span class="toc-page">9</span></li>
                    <li><span>Introduction</span><span class="toc-page">10</span></li>
                    <li><span>Threat actors and motivations</span><span class="toc-page">11</span></li>
                    <li><span>Nation-state threats</span><span class="toc-page">12</span></li>
                    <li><span>Ransomware</span><span class="toc-page">27</span></li>
                    <li><span>Fraud</span><span class="toc-page">31</span></li>
                    <li><span>Identity and social engineering</span><span class="toc-page">39</span></li>
                    <li><span>Distributed denial of service (DDoS) attacks</span><span class="toc-page">50</span></li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

</body>
</html>
